           <property name="text">
            <string>Mica and Mica Alt need Windows 11 22H2 or later; on Windows 10, Acrylic uses the older acrylic blur. Changing the backdrop, including turning it on or off, applies immediately. The window is drawn opaque while Windows transparency effects are off or in a Remote Desktop session.</string>
